  (text
    "Root sheet = wired system block diagram: every wire here is a hierarchical sheet pin connection (no global labels for signals).\nPower rails (+12V, +3V3, +0V95, +1V8, +1V2, +3V7_S1..3) are distributed as power symbols inside the sheets.\nPCIe: switch DS ports -> slots (Gen3 x1 + REFCLK + CLKREQ#), PERST# fan-out.  USB: USB5744 DS ports 1-3 -> slots (USB2 + USB3).\nControl: TCA6416A expanders -> slot FCPO#/RESET/W_DISABLE/PCIE_EN/PCIE_SEL(M.2 pin 20)/WAKE#, buck enables / PGOOD; host I2C to hub + PCIe switch."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 40.64 520.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "1a9dc512-fdb9-5322-99df-9d8fb2130f39"))
